  "An octopus can radically deform its shape.",
  "This lets it squeeze through small gaps.",
  "They trail their appendages behind them as they swim backwards.",
  "Using a siphon, they shoot water jets to move around.",
  "With a complex nervous system, they are among the most intelligent invertebrates.",
  "After delivering sperm, the male octopus becomes senescent and dies."
